<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>CRISPR WHISPR | Observation Terminal</title>
<style>
:root{--black:#141414;--red:#D92D0B;--gray:#A6ABA1;--ivory:#DADBD0;--shadow:#414743}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--black);color:var(--ivory);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%,#282b28 0%,#141414 62%)}.terminal{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px 18px 60px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--shadow);padding-bottom:13px}.brand{font-size:14px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.27em}.classified{color:var(--red);font:700 11px monospace;letter-spacing:.15em}.eyebrow{color:var(--gray);font:12px monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;margin:26px 0 8px}h1{font-family:Impact,'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:clamp(35px,7vw,72px);font-weight:900;margin:0 0 6px}h2{font-family:Impact,'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.07em;font-size:32px;margin:0 0 10px}.sub{color:var(--gray);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 25px}.panel{border:1px solid var(--shadow);background:#1b1d1b;padding:22px}.intro{max-width:680px;margin:50px auto;text-align:center}.intro p{color:var(--gray);line-height:1.65}.button{background:var(--red);color:white;border:1px solid var(--red);padding:14px 19px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.09em;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px}.button:hover{background:#a52209}.button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}.stats{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:18px}.stat{flex:1;min-width:125px;border:1px solid var(--shadow);padding:14px 17px;background:#1b1d1b}.stat-label{font:11px monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:6px}.stat-value{font:700 30px Impact,'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em}.timer{color:var(--red)}.photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px}.photo-panel{border:1px solid var(--shadow);background:#1b1d1b;padding:12px}.photo-panel.mutated{border-color:#8e2617}.photo-label{font:700 12px monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;margin:0 0 12px}.mutated .photo-label{color:var(--red)}.photo-frame{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;background:#101110;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.photo-frame img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.photo-frame:after{content:'';pointer-events:none;position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 0,transparent 5px,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 6px);opacity:.5}.missing{font:12px monospace;color:var(--gray);padding:20px;text-align:center}.repair{margin-top:20px}.repair h2{font-size:26px}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin:16px 0}label{display:block;font:11px monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:8px}input{width:100%;background:#101110;border:1px solid #59605b;color:var(--ivory);padding:14px;font:700 21px monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;outline:none}input:focus{border-color:var(--red)}.status{min-height:30px;margin:14px 0 0;font:700 13px monospace;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:.04em}.success{color:#a9c1a2}.error{color:#ff735c}.info{color:var(--gray)}.hidden{display:none!important}.end{text-align:center;margin:50px auto;max-width:650px}.end .final{font:80px Impact,sans-serif;color:var(--red)}footer{margin-top:30px;color:#7d857e;font:10px monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-align:center}@media(max-width:600px){.photos{gap:8px}.photo-panel{padding:7px}.photo-label{font-size:10px}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}input{font-size:18px}.terminal{padding:15px 10px 35px}}
</style>
</head>
<body><main class="terminal"><header class="top"><span class="brand">CRISPR WHISPR</span><span class="classified">RESTRICTED ACCESS // 01</span></header>
<p class="eyebrow">GENETIC RECONSTRUCTION ARCHIVE</p><h1>OBSERVATION TERMINAL</h1><p class="sub">Two mutations detected. Compare both photos and tell your Decoder what the subject looked like BEFORE mutation. Retrieve both repair sequences before time runs out.</p>
<section id="rulesArea" class="panel" aria-labelledby="rulesHeading" style="margin-bottom:18px">
<div class="photo-label" id="rulesHeading" style="margin-bottom:14px">GENETICIST RULES</div>
<div style="border:2px solid var(--red);background:#251815;padding:15px;margin-bottom:15px;line-height:1.65">
<strong style="color:#ff7865">CRITICAL: REPORT THE ORIGINAL  NOT THE MUTATION.</strong><br>
The MUTATED photo shows what went wrong. The ORIGINAL photo shows what must be restored. <strong>Tell your Decoder the ORIGINAL features needed for repair.</strong><br>
<span style="color:#ff9888">WRONG: “The mutated eyes are completely white.”</span><br>
<span style="color:#b9dcb0">RIGHT: “Restore brown eyes.”</span>
</div>
<ol style="margin:0;padding-left:22px;line-height:1.65">
<li style="padding-left:5px;margin-bottom:10px"><strong>Phase 1 — Compare.</strong> Look at both photos and find the TWO changed traits.</li>
<li style="padding-left:5px;margin-bottom:10px"><strong>Phase 1 — Communicate.</strong> Describe the TWO ORIGINAL features to restore. <strong>Do not describe the mutated features to your Decoder.</strong></li>
<li style="padding-left:5px;margin-bottom:10px"><strong>Phase 2 — Receive.</strong> Your Decoder searches gene codes and tells you the TWO repair sequences for those original features.</li>
<li style="padding-left:5px"><strong>Phase 2 — Enter.</strong> Enter both repair sequences to stabilize the subject.</li>
</ol>
<div style="border-left:3px solid var(--red);padding:12px 14px;margin-top:17px;background:#151715;line-height:1.6"><strong>Your goal:</strong> Restore what was originally there. ORIGINAL = ANSWER. MUTATED = CLUE.</div>
</section>
<section id="startArea" class="panel intro"><h2>SUBJECTS ARE UNSTABLE</h2><p>You have 07:00 to stabilize as many subjects as possible. Work with your partner. Both repair codes are required to complete each subject.</p><button id="startButton" class="button">BEGIN RECONSTRUCTION // 07:00</button></section>
<section id="gameArea" class="hidden"><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">TIME REMAINING</div><div class="stat-value timer" id="timer">07:00</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">SUBJECTS REPAIRED</div><div class="stat-value" id="score">0</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">ACTIVE SUBJECT</div><div class="stat-value" id="subjectNumber">001</div></div></div>
<div style="border-left:4px solid var(--red);background:#251815;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 15px;font:700 13px/1.65 monospace;letter-spacing:.025em" role="note"><span style="color:#ff7865">REPORT THE ORIGINAL FEATURES!</span> MUTATED = what went wrong. ORIGINAL = what your Decoder needs to restore.<div style="color:#b9dcb0;margin-top:5px">Example: mutated white eyes + original brown eyes → tell the Decoder “BROWN EYES.”</div></div>
<div class="photos"><div class="photo-panel"><div class="photo-label">ORIGINAL // BASELINE</div><div class="photo-frame"><img id="originalPhoto" alt="Original subject portrait"><span id="originalMissing" class="missing hidden">BASELINE IMAGE UNAVAILABLE</span></div></div><div class="photo-panel mutated"><div class="photo-label">MUTATED // ACTIVE</div><div class="photo-frame"><img id="mutatedPhoto" alt="Mutated subject portrait"><span id="mutatedMissing" class="missing hidden">MUTATED IMAGE UNAVAILABLE</span></div></div></div>
<div class="panel repair"><h2>AUTHORIZE GENETIC REPAIR</h2><p class="sub">Enter two DNA sequences. The dash is inserted automatically.</p><form id="repairForm"><div class="fields"><div><label for="code1">REPAIR SEQUENCE 01</label><input id="code1" type="text" maxlength="7" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="AAA-TTT" required></div><div><label for="code2">REPAIR SEQUENCE 02</label><input id="code2" type="text" maxlength="7" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="AAA-TTT" required></div></div><button id="repairButton" class="button" type="submit">AUTHORIZE REPAIR</button></form><div id="status" class="status info" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section>
<section id="endArea" class="panel end hidden"><p class="classified">SESSION TERMINATED</p><h2>RECONSTRUCTION COMPLETE</h2><p class="sub">SUBJECTS SUCCESSFULLY REPAIRED</p><div id="finalScore" class="final">0</div><button id="restartButton" class="button">START NEW SESSION</button></section><footer>CRISPR WHISPR // EXPERIMENTAL GENETIC REPAIR SYSTEM</footer></main>
<script>
// Repair sequences refer to original traits. Subject 02 uses corrected repair codes, while retaining its previously uploaded image filename.
const subjects = [
  {number:'001',original:'faces/subject01_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject01_mutated_cga-att-atg-cct.png',repairs:['CGA-ATT','ATG-CCT']},
  {number:'002',original:'faces/subject02_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject02_mutated_ggt-cca-tgc-acc.png',repairs:['GGT-CAA','TGC-AAC']},
  {number:'003',original:'faces/subject03_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject03_mutated_aac-gct-tac-gga.png',repairs:['AAC-GCT','TAC-GGA']},
  {number:'004',original:'faces/subject04_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject04_mutated_ggt-caa-ggg-tct.png',repairs:['GGT-CAA','GGG-TCT']},
  {number:'005',original:'faces/subject05_original.png',mutated:'faces/subject05_mutated_tac-gga-cga-att.png',repairs:['TAC-GGA','CGA-ATT']},
  {number:'006',original:'faces/subject06_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject06_mutated_cga-att-ggg-tct.png',repairs:['CGA-ATT','GGG-TCT']},
  {number:'007',original:'faces/subject07_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject07_mutated_tgc-aac-atg-cct.png',repairs:['TGC-AAC','ATG-CCT']},
  {number:'008',original:'faces/subject08_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject08_mutated_tac-gga-cta-ggc.png',repairs:['TAC-GGA','CTA-GGC']},
  {number:'009',original:'faces/subject09_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject09_mutated_gca-ttg-aac-gct.png',repairs:['GCA-TTG','AAC-GCT']},
  {number:'010',original:'faces/subject10_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject10_mutated_atg-cct-cta-ggc.png',repairs:['ATG-CCT','CTA-GGC']},
  {number:'011',original:'faces/subject11_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject11_mutated_atg-cct-ggg-tct.png',repairs:['ATG-CCT','GGG-TCT']},
  {number:'012',original:'faces/subject12_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject12_mutated_cga-att-cta-ggc.png',repairs:['CGA-ATT','CTA-GGC']},
  {number:'013',original:'faces/subject13_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject13_mutated_tgc-aac-atg-cct.png',repairs:['TGC-AAC','ATG-CCT']},
  {number:'014',original:'faces/subject14_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject14_mutated_aac-gct-gca-ttg.png',repairs:['AAC-GCT','GCA-TTG']},
  {number:'015',original:'faces/subject15_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject15_mutated_atg-cct-cta-ggc.png',repairs:['ATG-CCT','CTA-GGC']},
  {number:'016',original:'faces/subject16_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject16_mutated_tgc-aac-ggg-tct.png',repairs:['TGC-AAC','GGG-TCT']},
  {number:'017',original:'faces/subject17_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject17_mutated_tgc-aac-atg-cct.png',repairs:['TGC-AAC','ATG-CCT']},
  {number:'018',original:'faces/subject18_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject18_mutated_cga-att-gca-ttg.png',repairs:['CGA-ATT','GCA-TTG']},
  {number:'019',original:'faces/subject19_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject19_mutated_cga-att-atg-cct.png',repairs:['CGA-ATT','ATG-CCT']},
  {number:'020',original:'faces/subject20_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject20_mutated_gca-ttg-ggg-tct.png',repairs:['GCA-TTG','GGG-TCT']},
  {number:'021',original:'faces/subject21_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject21_mutated_gca-ttg-ggg-tct.png',repairs:['GCA-TTG','GGG-TCT']},
  {number:'022',original:'faces/subject22_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject22_mutated_cta-ggc-cga-att.png',repairs:['CTA-GGC','CGA-ATT']},
  {number:'023',original:'faces/subject23_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject23_mutated_tac-gga-tgc-aac.png',repairs:['TAC-GGA','TGC-AAC']},
  {number:'024',original:'faces/subject24_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject24_mutated_atg-cct-cga-att.png',repairs:['ATG-CCT','CGA-ATT']},
  {number:'025',original:'faces/subject25_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject25_mutated_ggt-caa-cga-att.png',repairs:['GGT-CAA','CGA-ATT']},
  {number:'026',original:'faces/subject26_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject26_mutated_cga-att-ggg-tct.png',repairs:['CGA-ATT','GGG-TCT']},
  {number:'027',original:'faces/subject27_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject27_mutated_atg-cct-tgc-aac.png',repairs:['ATG-CCT','TGC-AAC']},
  {number:'028',original:'faces/subject28_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject28_mutated_gca-ttg-cga-att.png',repairs:['GCA-TTG','CGA-ATT']},
  {number:'029',original:'faces/subject29_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject29_mutated_ggt-caa-atg-cct.png',repairs:['GGT-CAA','ATG-CCT']},
  {number:'030',original:'faces/subject30_original.jpeg',mutated:'faces/subject30_mutated_atg-cct-ggt-caa.png',repairs:['ATG-CCT','GGT-CAA']}
];
const ROUND_SECONDS=420;
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
let timeLeft=ROUND_SECONDS,score=0,active=null,timerHandle=null,nextHandle=null,locked=false,queue=[];
function formatDNA(raw){const letters=String(raw).toUpperCase().replace(/[^ATGC]/g,'').slice(0,6);return letters.length>3?letters.slice(0,3)+'-'+letters.slice(3):letters;}
function attachDNAInput(el){el.addEventListener('input',()=>{const pos=el.selectionStart;const old=el.value;const before=old.slice(0,pos).replace(/[^ATGCatgc]/g,'').length;el.value=formatDNA(old);const newPos=Math.min(el.value.length,before+(before>3?1:0));el.setSelectionRange(newPos,newPos);});}
attachDNAInput($('code1'));attachDNAInput($('code2'));
function setStatus(message,type='info'){$('status').textContent=message;$('status').className='status '+type;}
function showImage(imgId,missingId,path){const img=$(imgId),missing=$(missingId);img.classList.remove('hidden');missing.classList.add('hidden');img.onerror=()=>{img.classList.add('hidden');missing.classList.remove('hidden');};img.onload=()=>{img.classList.remove('hidden');missing.classList.add('hidden');};img.src=path;}
function refillQueue(){queue=subjects.map((_,i)=>i);for(let i=queue.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[queue[i],queue[j]]=[queue[j],queue[i]];}if(subjects.length>1&&active){const last=subjects.indexOf(active);if(queue[0]===last)[queue[0],queue[queue.length-1]]=[queue[queue.length-1],queue[0]];}}
function nextSubject(){if(timeLeft<=0)return; if(!queue.length)refillQueue();active=subjects[queue.shift()];locked=false;$('subjectNumber').textContent=active.number;$('code1').value='';$('code2').value='';$('repairButton').disabled=false;setStatus('AWAITING TWO REPAIR SEQUENCES','info');showImage('originalPhoto','originalMissing',active.original);showImage('mutatedPhoto','mutatedMissing',active.mutated);$('code1').focus();}
function renderTime(){const m=Math.floor(timeLeft/60),s=timeLeft%60;$('timer').textContent=String(m).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(s).padStart(2,'0');}
function finish(){clearInterval(timerHandle);clearTimeout(nextHandle);timerHandle=null;locked=true;$('gameArea').classList.add('hidden');$('endArea').classList.remove('hidden');$('finalScore').textContent=score;}
function start(){if(!subjects.length){alert("No subjects configured yet.");return;}clearInterval(timerHandle);clearTimeout(nextHandle);timeLeft=ROUND_SECONDS;score=0;active=null;queue=[];locked=false;$('score').textContent='0';renderTime();$('startArea').classList.add('hidden');$('endArea').classList.add('hidden');$('gameArea').classList.remove('hidden');nextSubject();timerHandle=setInterval(()=>{timeLeft--;renderTime();if(timeLeft<=0)finish();},1000);}
$('repairForm').addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();if(locked||!active||timeLeft<=0)return;const a=formatDNA($('code1').value),b=formatDNA($('code2').value);if(a.length!==7||b.length!==7){setStatus('ENTER TWO COMPLETE SIX-LETTER SEQUENCES','error');return;}const submitted=[a,b].sort(),expected=[...active.repairs].sort();if(submitted[0]===expected[0]&&submitted[1]===expected[1]){locked=true;score++;$('score').textContent=score;$('repairButton').disabled=true;setStatus('GENETIC REPAIR SUCCESSFUL — SUBJECT STABILIZED','success');nextHandle=setTimeout(nextSubject,1400);}else{setStatus('REPAIR REJECTED — VERIFY BOTH SEQUENCES','error');}});
$('startButton').addEventListener('click',start);$('restartButton').addEventListener('click',start);
</script></body></html>
